      "extract": "Introduction In [16, 17] Kashaev deﬁned the Kashaev invariant ⟨L ⟩N ∈C of a link L for N = 2, 3, · · · by using the quantum dilogarithm. In [18] he conjectured that, for any hyperbolic link L, 2π · lim N→∞ log ⟨L ⟩N N = vol(S3 −L), where “vol” denotes the hyperbolic volume, and gave evidence for the conjecture for the ﬁgure-eight knot, the 52 knot and the 61 knot, by formal calculations. In 1999, H. Murakami and J.",
